    "detailed_description": "<i>This game was created as part of Viking's newcomer training program<br>Depending on your PC environment, the game may not run properly<br>Also, unforeseen problems may occur during the game<br>Please be aware of this</i><br><br><strong>A controller is required to play this game!</strong><br><br><strong>A magical world full of sweets!</strong><br>The heroine, Leila, is a wizard girl who loves sweets. She comes to the world of sweets with her &quot;Sweets Parasol,&quot; a magical umbrella that turns sweets into power!<br>A magical sweet adventure filled with sweets begins now!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/4bdb77aabe01bb55e18d50de52d92cd2.avif?t=1743409107\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A great adventure in the sweet world by a sweet lover.</h2><br><strong>Side-scrolling gliding action with fun fluffy controls</strong><br>Adventure through the world of sweets, using the unique &quot;gliding&quot; action of umbrellas!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/d7f8f2226efc50a71c05f6838aeda9e9.poster.avif?t=1743409107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/d7f8f2226efc50a71c05f6838aeda9e9.webm?t=1743409107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/d7f8f2226efc50a71c05f6838aeda9e9.mp4?t=1743409107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gliding is not the only action!</h2>Attack by swinging umbrellas!\u3000Attack by firing candies!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/194be6fb38f42956460b280c2ffa8295.poster.avif?t=1743409107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/194be6fb38f42956460b280c2ffa8295.webm?t=1743409107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/194be6fb38f42956460b280c2ffa8295.mp4?t=1743409107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/33d6b967a8ec2df0beb01ac21ddb7394.poster.avif?t=1743409107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/33d6b967a8ec2df0beb01ac21ddb7394.webm?t=1743409107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/33d6b967a8ec2df0beb01ac21ddb7394.mp4?t=1743409107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take down the enemies that get in your way with a variety of actions!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/5110c5eac70a7e4f52bec23746d77960.poster.avif?t=1743409107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/5110c5eac70a7e4f52bec23746d77960.webm?t=1743409107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/5110c5eac70a7e4f52bec23746d77960.mp4?t=1743409107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cute enemies fused with sweets</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/16f14c28cf5f31527260d70bb91c58cd.avif?t=1743409107\" /></div><br>Sweets creatures will be terrorizing Leila's adventures!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/7c63696bfc91cb61a50f5521a4a1ebad.poster.avif?t=1743409107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/7c63696bfc91cb61a50f5521a4a1ebad.webm?t=1743409107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/7c63696bfc91cb61a50f5521a4a1ebad.mp4?t=1743409107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">There is more than one way to clear!</h2>There are different routes and secret areas in the stage!<br>Walk around the corner, take a big, bold jump, and<br>Make your own way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103190/extras/028d47268f779b264527b69a3bac2ee8.avif?t=1743409107\" data-has-big /></div>",
